  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 植\ntitle: plant; put in the ground\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-3, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 12\nradical: 木\nradicalNumber: 75\nonyomi: [ショク]\nkunyomi: [う.える, う.わる]\ndistractors: [値, 直, 真]\n---\n\n# 植 — plant; put in the ground\n\n**Strokes:** 12 · **Key (radical):** 木 (no. 75) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n植 concerns planting. 植える うえる is the transitive verb to plant something; 植わる うわる describes something being planted. 植物 しょくぶつ names plants or vegetation.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Notice 木 beside 直 and imagine setting a young tree straight in the soil. This is a modern-shape memory aid, not a verified origin or phonetic claim.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ショク | on | [植物](../words/植物.md) しょくぶつ - plant; vegetation |\n| う.える | kun | [植える](../words/植える.md) うえる - plant; [田植え](../words/田植え.md) たうえ - rice-seedling planting (植え うえ) |\n| う.わる | kun | 植わる うわる - be planted |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [植える](../words/植える.md) うえる - plant\n- [田植え](../words/田植え.md) たうえ - rice-seedling planting\n- [植物](../words/植物.md) しょくぶつ - plant; vegetation\n- [植木](../words/植木.md) うえき - garden tree; potted plant\n- 植わる うわる - be planted\n\n## Notes\n\n- Compare 木を植える きをうえる, plant a tree, with 木が植わっている きがうわっている, a tree is planted there. The object of the first construction is the subject of the second.\n- 植える is ichidan, with 植えて うえて. 植わる is godan, with 植わって うわって; it is an intransitive verb, not the grammatical passive form of 植える.\n- Compare [値](値.md), value or price: the left side changes from 木 to 亻.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1357250, 1357260, 1357300, 1442810, 1587970.\n",
